1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,930
Build or buy? Ask these five questions first, before anyone opens a vendor deck.

2
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:13,600
Is it how you win, or table stakes? How sensitive is the data? How soon do you need it? What does three years cost? What would it cost to leave? Write the answers down and revisit them at every renewal.

3
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:19,260
Table stakes: buy. How you win: build. High exit cost: negotiate it before you sign.

4
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:24,260
Price the exit before you sign. Save this before the vendor demo.
